msgid "Generate a new QR code? The currently printed code will STOP working."
msgstr ""
"Buat kode QR baru? Kode yang tercetak saat ini akan BERHENTI berfungsi."

msgid "Regenerate QR code"
msgstr "Buat ulang kode QR"

msgid ""
"Use this if a code was copied or misused. Old printouts stop working "
"immediately."
msgstr ""
"Gunakan ini jika kode disalin atau disalahgunakan. Cetakan lama langsung "
"tidak berlaku."

