msgid "Delete table %(n)s? Past orders are kept."
msgstr "Hapus meja %(n)s? Pesanan sebelumnya tetap disimpan."

msgid "Delete table"
msgstr "Hapus meja"

msgid "Tables &amp; QR codes"
msgstr "Meja &amp; kode QR"

msgid ""
"Each table has its own QR code. Customers scan it to see the menu and order."
msgstr ""
"Setiap meja punya kode QR sendiri. Pelanggan memindainya untuk melihat menu "
"dan memesan."

msgid "Print all QR codes"
msgstr "Cetak semua kode QR"

