msgstr "%(n)s aktif"

msgid "Download PNG"
msgstr "Unduh PNG"

msgid "No tables yet. Add your first table below."
msgstr "Belum ada meja. Tambahkan meja pertama Anda di bawah."

msgid "Add a table"
msgstr "Tambah meja"

msgid "Use numbers or short codes like 12 or A-3."
msgstr "Gunakan angka atau kode singkat seperti 12 atau A-3."

msgid "Add table"
msgstr "Tambah meja"

msgid "Add many tables"
msgstr "Tambah banyak meja"

msgid "Creates numbered tables, skipping numbers that already exist."
msgstr "Membuat meja bernomor, melewati nomor yang sudah ada."

msgid "Create tables"
msgstr "Buat meja"

msgid "QR menu & table ordering for restaurants"
msgstr "Menu QR & pemesanan di meja untuk restoran"

msgid "Scan. Order. Enjoy."
msgstr "Scan. Pesan. Nikmati."

msgid ""
"A QR code menu and table ordering for your restaurant. Customers scan the "
"code on the table, order from their phone, and the order goes straight to "
"your kitchen. They don't need an app or an account."
msgstr ""
"Menu kode QR dan pemesanan di meja untuk restoran Anda. Pelanggan memindai "
"kode di meja, memesan dari ponsel, dan pesanan langsung masuk ke dapur. "
"Mereka tidak perlu aplikasi atau akun."

msgid "Open dashboard"
msgstr "Buka dasbor"

msgid "How it works"
msgstr "Cara kerjanya"

msgid "Create your menu"
msgstr "Buat menu Anda"

msgid ""
"Add dishes, photos, prices and add-ons in English, Tetum and Bahasa "
"Indonesia."
msgstr ""
"Tambahkan hidangan, foto, harga, dan tambahan dalam bahasa Inggris, Tetun, "
"dan Bahasa Indonesia."

msgid "Print your QR codes"
msgstr "Cetak kode QR Anda"

msgid "One code per table. Print them and place one on each table."
msgstr "Satu kode per meja. Cetak dan letakkan satu di setiap meja."

msgid "Receive orders live"
msgstr "Terima pesanan secara langsung"

msgid ""
"Orders appear instantly on the kitchen screen with a sound alert. Customers "
"can follow their order on their phone."
msgstr ""
"Pesanan langsung muncul di layar dapur dengan bunyi peringatan. Pelanggan "
"dapat memantau pesanan di ponsel."

msgid "Works on any phone"
msgstr "Bisa di ponsel apa saja"

msgid ""
"Customers scan with the phone camera. No app, no account, and it loads fast "
"on slow connections."
msgstr ""
"Pelanggan memindai dengan kamera ponsel. Tanpa aplikasi, tanpa akun, dan "
"cepat dimuat meski koneksi lambat."

msgid "Kitchen screen"
msgstr "Layar dapur"

msgid "New → Preparing → Ready → Completed, with timers and notes."
msgstr "Baru → Disiapkan → Siap → Selesai, dengan pengatur waktu dan catatan."

msgid "Tables & sessions"
msgstr "Meja & sesi"

msgid ""
"Several people can order from one table, and you see one bill per table."
msgstr ""
"Beberapa orang dapat memesan dari satu meja, dan Anda melihat satu tagihan "
"per meja."

msgid "Cash & change"
msgstr "Tunai & kembalian"

msgid "Mark orders paid in one tap, and see the change to give back."
msgstr ""
"Tandai pesanan lunas dengan sekali ketuk, dan lihat kembalian yang harus "
"diberikan."

msgid "Sold out in one tap"
msgstr "Tandai habis sekali ketuk"

msgid "Customers' menus update immediately."
msgstr "Menu pelanggan langsung diperbarui."

msgid "Daily revenue, best sellers and CSV export."
msgstr "Pendapatan harian, menu terlaris, dan ekspor CSV."

msgid "Pricing"
msgstr "Harga"

msgid "Simple monthly plans. No setup fees."
msgstr "Paket bulanan sederhana. Tanpa biaya pemasangan."

